</string-name>, <string-name><surname>Mensink</surname><given-names>PB</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Lequin</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>Aktas</surname><given-names>H</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>de Krijger</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></string-name>, <string-name><surname>van der Woude</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></string-name>, <etal/></person-group>. <article-title>Single-balloon enteroscopy, magnetic resonance enterography, and abdominal US useful for evaluation of small-bowel disease in children with (suspected) Crohn&#x02019;s disease</article-title>. <source>Gastrointest Endosc</source>. <year>2012</year>;<volume>75</volume>(<issue>1</issue>):<fpage>87</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>94</lpage>.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">21963066</pub-id>
